      "claim": "International treaties function as regulatory theater, creating a false sense of security while actively stifling the decentralized innovation required to solve our most pressing existential threats.",
      "targets": []
    },
    {
      "claim": "Market-based accountability, enforced through cryptographic verification and strict liability, provides a more robust and scalable safety mechanism than state-level consensus.",
      "targets": []
    }
